# Google Maps JavaScript API key, used by the "Portail Citoyen" network map.
# Get one at https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis — enable the
# "Maps JavaScript API", then restrict the key to this app's domain(s).
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
# Optional Google Cloud map ID. A vector map ID enables terrain tilt/heading in 3D mode.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAP_ID=
